Subject: [PATCH] Size the text indent title from its implicit layout height

The RowLayout positions and sizes its children from its allocated height.
Using childrenRect.height as that height feeds the layout result back into
its input. Use its size hint, as the FontStyle title already does.

diff --git a/plugins/dockers/textproperties/qml/TextIndent.qml b/plugins/dockers/textproperties/qml/TextIndent.qml
--- a/plugins/dockers/textproperties/qml/TextIndent.qml
+++ b/plugins/dockers/textproperties/qml/TextIndent.qml
@@ -99,7 +99,7 @@
 
     titleItem: RowLayout {
         width: parent.width;
-        height: childrenRect.height;
+        height: implicitHeight;
         spacing: columnSpacing;
 
         Kis.DoubleSliderSpinBox {
